<title>PHILIPPINES: TABLE-CITYLAND H1 NET 152.49 MLN PESOS.</title>
<headline>TABLE-CITYLAND H1 NET 152.49 MLN PESOS.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>			(in million pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net income			   152.49 vs 152.96</p>
<p>    Revenues			     313.20 vs 314.32</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (pesos)	 0.42 vs 0.42</p>
<p>Note: Full name is Cityland Development Corp. The company said it made 69.06 million pesos in net income for the second quarter against 83.18 million a year ago.</p>
